detaileddescription.para:
Iterator to the first value in the matrix.

Example: slt::DenseMatrix<float>mat(2,3,1.0f);

for(autoit=mat.begin();it!=mat.end();++it){
std::cout<<*it<<"";
}
//Output:111111

Example: slt::DenseMatrix<float>mat(3,3,1.0f);
auto*ptr=mat.begin();
ptr[0]=42.0f;//modifieselement(0,0)

Iterator to one past the last value.

Example: slt::DenseMatrix<float>mat(2,3,2.0f);

for(constauto&value:mat){
std::cout<<value<<"";
}
//Output:222222

csr



The input SparseCSRMatrix to convert. 




Reference to this DenseMatrix after assignment.



std::out_of_range



if index bounds are violated internally.



Example: slt::SparseCSRMatrix<float>csr=build_sparse_matrix();
slt::DenseMatrix<float>dense;
dense=csr;
